{"tail":"The father of mercy will have mercy upon the people borne by Him and remember the covenant with the eternal ones (forefathers) and deliver our souls from evil hours and rebuke the evil inclination from those whom He has lifted up and favour us for eternal refuge and fulfil our prayers with a full measure of salvation and compassion. "}
